ind":"announcement","title":"🔥It's Show Time! Steam Next Fest Is Live — The Demo Rebuilt From Scratch!🔥","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here!We enter the festival with an incredible milestone: 10,000 wishlists!First, a massive THANK YOU to everyone who has supported Army Troop Remastered. Your support means everything to us!To celebrate, we have some HUGE news.We've rebuilt almost the entire game from the ground up!Our goal was simple: push Army Troop Remastered to an entirely new level of quality, intensity, and performance.And today, we're excited to unveil our completely overhauled demo!SOLDIERS REBUILT FRO","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:50:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3361860-1810503566464481","game_id":"steam-3361860","kind":"announcement","title":"🎥 New Gameplay Video – Watch the MP40 in Action!","summary":"We’ve got something special to share! A streamer recently jumped into Army Troop Remastered and showed off some impressive skills with the MP40. If you want to see how intense the battles can get (and how deadly this weapon can be in the right hands), check out the video here:👉 Don’t forget, you can also try it yourself in the free demo available right now on Steam! Wishlist & Follow to stay updated — more content is on the way. 💪","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-12T23:20:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566464481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3361860-1810503566464043","game_id":"steam-3361860","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 The Demo is Live – Play Now! 🎉","summary":"Troopers, the wait is 